        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Pavement\n- Products: \"Rattled by the Rush\", Wowee Zowee\n- Places: Stockton, California\n- Events: Pavement's formation, release of \"Rattled by the Rush\", Pavement's reunion tour\n\nFacts:\n- Pavement was an American indie rock band that formed in Stockton, California in 1989.\n- In 1995, Pavement released \"Rattled by the Rush\" as a single/EP.\n- \"Rattled by the Rush\" was the single for the song \"Rattled by the Rush,\" which was the first single from Pavement's third album, Wowee Zowee, released in 1995.\n- In 2010, Pavement undertook a well-received reunion tour.",
